विमूढा नानुपश्यन्ति पश्यन्ति ज्ञानचक्षुष: ॥ १० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4046,\"bb\":3558,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/15/10/b3558/\",\"body_value\":\"utkrāmantaṁ sthitaṁ vāpi
bhuñjānaṁ vā guṇānvitam
